sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant UI as Signup page
  participant AC as AuthContext
  participant API as api.js
  participant BE as routers/auth.py
  participant DB as SQLite
  U->>UI: fill the form and submit
  UI->>UI: validate with validators.js
  UI->>AC: signup(name, email, password)
  AC->>API: POST /auth/signup
  API->>BE: JSON body
  BE->>BE: Pydantic checks the shape (SignupIn)
  BE->>DB: is the email already used?
  BE->>BE: bcrypt hashes the password
  BE->>DB: INSERT user
  BE->>BE: sign a JWT (sub = user id, valid 7 days)
  BE-->>API: token and user
  API->>API: store token in localStorage
  AC->>AC: setUser(user)
  Note over U,DB: Later, on every page load or API call
  AC->>API: GET /auth/me with header Authorization Bearer token
  BE->>BE: get_current_user decodes and verifies the JWT
  BE->>DB: load the user
  BE-->>AC: user, or 401 and the token is discarded
